  "card": "Backports six pull requests to the 32.x release branch (#36277, #36303, #36340, #36392, #36404, #36435). Key fixes include ensuring private broadcast completes all three initial peer connections while avoiding stale retries, and capping Sock::WaitMany timeouts so bitcoin-cli -rpcclienttimeout=0 functions properly on macOS and BSD without select() rejecting the large timeout. Additional commits isolate CI container networks, resolve private broadcast fuzz seeding, and enhance HTTP throttling tests.",
